SSELFIE Brand Studio - Luxury Mobile Design Implementation
Overview
Complete redesign of SSELFIE Brand Studio using luxury mobile-first design principles based on the demo app style guide. All components have been redesigned to provide a consistent, high-end user experience.

IMPORTANT: This application uses Vercel serverless functions, not Express.js

Architecture
Vercel Serverless Infrastructure
The application is built for Vercel serverless deployment:

Frontend: Vite + React (mobile-first)
Backend: Vercel serverless functions in /api directory
Main Handler: /api/index.ts - consolidated serverless function
Authentication: Stack Auth via serverless functions
Database: NeonDB (Serverless Postgres)
AI Integration: Claude API & Gemini AI via serverless functions
Key API Endpoints (Vercel Serverless)
// Main consolidated handler
/api/index.ts - Primary serverless function

// Authentication & User Management
GET /api/auth/user - User profile and authentication
GET /api/user-model - Training status and model information

// Training System
POST /api/start-model-training - Initiate AI model training
GET /api/training/status - Monitor training progress

// Gallery & Images
GET /api/gallery - User's photo collection
POST /api/gallery/{id}/like - Photo interactions
POST /api/gallery/{id}/save - Save functionality

// Maya AI (Serverless)
POST /api/maya/chat - Maya conversation & concept generation
POST /api/maya/generate - AI photo generation
Components Architecture
1. LuxuryMobileApp.tsx
Main app container using serverless APIs

