Fetches from /api/gallery serverless endpoint
Real-time image interactions
No mock data - all serverless database connections
4. LuxuryTrainingPage.tsx
AI training via serverless functions

Uses /api/start-model-training for initialization
Progress tracking via /api/training/status
Real-time status updates
