Production Deployment
Vercel Configuration
File: vercel.json

{
 "functions": {
   "api/index.ts": { "maxDuration": 40 },
   "api/maya/chat.ts": { "maxDuration": 40 }
 },
 "rewrites": [
   {
     "source": "/((?!api/).*)",
     "destination": "/index.html"
   }
 ]
}
Build Process
npm run build - Client build via Vite
npm run vercel-build - Production build
Serverless functions deployed automatically
No Express server configuration needed
